#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.LiteFrameExpanding.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.LiteFrameExpanding"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.LiteFrameExpanding:1 of
msgid "Provide expanding window calculations."
msgstr "提供扩展窗口计算。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.LiteFrameExpanding:3 of
msgid ""
"Returns an intermediate object whose aggregation methods (``.sum()``, "
"``.mean()``, ...) compute a growing cumulative window from the start of "
"the partition to the current row.  Unlike ``cum*``, expanding fills NaN "
"positions with the accumulated value rather than masking them to null."
msgstr ""
"返回一个中间对象，其聚合方法（``.sum()``、``.mean()`` 等）从分区开始到"
"当前行计算不断增长的累积窗口。与 ``cum*`` 不同，扩展窗口用累积值填充 NaN "
"位置，而不是将其掩码为 null。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.LiteFrameExpanding.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.LiteFrameExpanding:8 of
msgid "The LiteFrame to compute on."
msgstr "要计算的 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.LiteFrameExpanding:10 of
msgid ""
"Minimum number of observations in the window required to produce a value "
"(otherwise null)."
msgstr "窗口中产生值所需的最小观测数（否则为 null）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.LiteFrameExpanding:13 of
msgid ""
"Column(s) to aggregate. If None, all columns are aggregated. Non-selected"
" columns are passed through unchanged."
msgstr "要聚合的列。如果为 None，则聚合所有列。未选择的列保持不变通过。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.expanding.LiteFrameExpanding:16 of
msgid ""
"Set when created from a ``groupby.expanding()`` call so the tiler "
"partitions data by group key before computing per-group windows."
msgstr ""
"从 ``groupby.expanding()`` 调用创建时设置，以便在计算每组窗口之前按分组键"
"对数据进行分区。"

